            "description": "Add node for replenishKanbanCards case branch",
            "name": "Add (replenishKanbanCards Case)"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "id": "add_replenishKanbanCards_1773645985307",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Return Message for Generate Temporary Kanban Card"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "RETURN_MESSAGE_FOR_GENERATE_TEMPORARY_KANBAN_CARD",
          "id": "1773646389473",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1773646389474_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Review the output of the CREATE_BATCH_TEMPORARY_CARDS and REPLENISH_TEMPORARY_KANBAN_CARDS  business object. You have the following context:\n1. {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_BATCH_TEMPORARY_CARDS.$output}} = response of the POST API call to generate the temporary kanban cards\n2. {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_BATCH_TEMPORARY_CARDS.$status}} = the status of the Rest API call to generate the temporary kanban cards\n3. {{$context.$nodes.REPLENISH_TEMPORARY_KANBAN_CARDS.$output}} = response of the POST API call to replenish the generated temporary kanban cards\n4. {{$context.$nodes.REPLENISH_TEMPORARY_KANBAN_CARDS.$status}} = the status of the Rest API call to replenish the generated temporary kanban cards\n\n\n- If the temporary Kanban card was created  and replenished successfully, return a simple message summarizing the key details of the new card (including the card number and relevant attributes).\n     - also mention which pull sequence of point of use cards were generated and replenished.\n- DO NOT display any id(s) or identifiers.\n- If the creation or replenishment failed, return a clear message explaining the reason for the failure based on the output.\n\nOnly provide the relevant success or failure message, with no extra text."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Context Indentifying Agent"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775644117669"
          },
          "code": "CONTEXT_INDENTIFYING_AGENT",
          "id": "1773660105931",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1773660105932_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an enterprise classification and extraction agent operating inside Oracle Fusion Cloud.\n\nTASK:\n\nGiven the current user message (or, if empty, the latest user message in chat history), produce exactly ONE JSON object that:\n1) Classifies the request context as ITEM, POINT_OF_USE, or NOTHING, and\n2) Extracts only the entities relevant to the chosen context.\n\nAdditionally, if the user explicitly mentions a threshold or deviation number, extract it verbatim into the threshold field. If no threshold or deviation number is mentioned, set threshold to \"20\".\n\n------------------------------\nINPUTS TO ANALYZE:\n\n- Current user message: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n- If empty, use latest user message in: {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}\n- Chat history is only for choosing the latest user message when the current message is empty. Do NOT extract entities from history.\n\n------------------------------\nCONTEXT CLASSIFICATION (choose exactly ONE):\n\n- \"ITEM\": The user explicitly references a specific item identifier (item number, SKU, product/material name).\n- \"POINT_OF_USE\": The user explicitly references a subinventory and/or locator (a physical storage/usage location).\n- \"NOTHING\": Neither an item nor a point-of-use is explicitly specified.\n\n------------------------------\nDOMINANCE RULE (when both appear):\n\n- Choose the context that best matches what the user is asking about.\n- Extract entities ONLY for the chosen context.\n- Do NOT populate fields for the non-chosen context.\n\n------------------------------\nEXTRACTION RULES (strict):\n\n- Extract ONLY strings that appear verbatim in the current user message. Do not infer, normalize, or correct casing/format.\n- If multiple entities of the chosen type appear, extract all of them into the corresponding list.\n- If none are present, use empty arrays.\n- Items go only in \"items\".\n- Subinventory/locator go only under \"point_of_use\".\n- Threshold/deviation numbers go only in \"threshold\".\n- If context is ITEM, keep subinventory/locator empty arrays.\n- If context is POINT_OF_USE, keep items empty array.\n- If context is NOTHING, all arrays must be empty.\n- If a threshold or deviation value is mentioned, extract it verbatim exactly as written.\n- If no threshold or deviation value is mentioned, set threshold to \"20\".\n- threshold is a number do not append \"%\" etc.\n------------------------------\nOUTPUT RULES (STRICT):\n\n- Output MUST be valid JSON.\n- Output ONLY the JSON object (no markdown, no commentary, no extra keys).\n- Use exactly this schema and key spelling/order:\n\n{\n  \"context\": \"ITEM\" | \"POINT_OF_USE\" | \"NOTHING\",\n  \"items\": [],\n  \"point_of_use\": {\n    \"subinventory\": [],\n    \"locator\": []\n  },\n  \"threshold\": \"\"\n}\n\n------------------------------\nEXAMPLES:\n\n1.\nInput: \"What is the status of item MFG-PL-PROD1 stock?\"\nOutput:\n{\n  \"context\": \"ITEM\",\n  \"items\": [\"MFG-PL-PROD1\"],\n  \"point_of_use\": {\n    \"subinventory\": [],\n    \"locator\": []\n  },\n  \"threshold\": \"20\"\n}\n\n2.\nInput: \"Show excess stock for subinventory Stores and locator 1.1.1 with threshold 10.\"\nOutput:\n{\n  \"context\": \"POINT_OF_USE\",\n  \"items\": [],\n  \"point_of_use\": {\n    \"subinventory\": [\"Stores\"],\n    \"locator\": [\"1.1.1\"]\n  },\n  \"threshold\": \"10\"\n}\n\n3.\nInput: \"I need an update.\"\nOutput:\n{\n  \"context\": \"NOTHING\",\n  \"items\": [],\n  \"point_of_use\": {\n    \"subinventory\": [],\n    \"locator\": []\n  },\n  \"threshold\": \"20\"\n}\n\n4.\nInput: \"Show items with shortage deviation above 35%\"\nOutput:\n{\n  \"context\": \"ITEM\",\n  \"items\": [],\n  \"point_of_use\": {\n    \"subinventory\": [],\n    \"locator\": []\n  },\n  \"threshold\": \"35\"\n}\n\n5.\nInput: \"Show items with shortage deviation above 32% for subinventory Stores.\"\nOutput:\n{\n  \"context\": \"POINT_OF_USE\",\n  \"items\": [],\n  \"point_of_use\": {\n    \"subinventory\": [\"Stores\"],\n    \"locator\": []\n  },\n  \"threshold\": \"32\"\n}\n\n6.\nInput: \"Show shortages for MFG-PL-PROD1 with shortage deviation as 14%.\"\nOutput:\n{\n  \"context\": \"ITEM\",\n  \"items\": [\"MFG-PL-PROD1\"],\n  \"point_of_use\": {\n    \"subinventory\": [],\n    \"locator\": []\n  },\n  \"threshold\": \"14\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "errorNodeId": "1773644544654",
            "name": "Query builder",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "const esc = (v) => String(v).trim().replace(/'/g, \"''\");\nconst parts = [];\n\nlet payload = $context.$nodes.CONTEXT_INDENTIFYING_AGENT.$output;\nif (!payload || typeof payload !== \"object\") return \"\";\n\n// ✅ Mandatory condition\nparts.push(\"SourceType<>4\");\n\nif (payload.context === \"ITEM\") {\n  const items = (payload.items || [])\n    .filter((x) => x != null && String(x).trim() !== \"\");\n\n  if (items.length) {\n    parts.push(\n      `ItemNumber IN (${items.map(item => `'${esc(item)}'`).join(\",\")})`\n    );\n  }\n\n} else if (payload.context === \"POINT_OF_USE\") {\n  const pou = payload.point_of_use || {};\n\n  const subs = (pou.subinventory || [])\n    .filter((x) => x != null && String(x).trim() !== \"\");\n\n  const locs = (pou.locator || [])\n    .filter((x) => x != null && String(x).trim() !== \"\");\n\n  if (subs.length) {\n    parts.push(\n      `SubinventoryCode IN (${subs.map(sub => `'${esc(sub)}'`).join(\",\")})`\n    );\n  }\n\n  if (locs.length) {\n    parts.push(\n      `Locator IN (${locs.map(loc => `'${esc(loc)}'`).join(\",\")})`\n    );\n  }\n}\n\nreturn parts.join(\" AND \");"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1773660911465"
          },
          "code": "QUERY_BUILDER",
          "id": "1773660502407",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
